  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced pork sausage and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they start to soften, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the diced chilli peppers and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cubed potatoes, sliced carrots, garlic free seasoning, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and canned tomatoes, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
